    "enUS": {
      "description": "The shield of the Dragonslayer is rumored to be held by an Orcish warlord in the Redridge Mountains. He stole it while raiding a human settlement.",
      "dialogue": {
        "33f7198a56d6cab12815": "Splendid job, $N! With this, I am one step further on my path to glory."
